# DESIGN DECISION (settled 2026-07-07, named per WS1 build plan §5 — dated
# rationale in feat-spl-003-assumption-dialogue_summary.md §Design Decision):
# correlation_id -> Slack thread-ts mapping is the Slack-ts-in-payload
# ROUND-TRIP (parent_request_id pattern), NOT a durable KV bucket. Jarvis
# holds zero mapping state; every inbound planning notification and
# checkpoint carries its own thread anchor, projected from forge SQLite
